// Own stress test (INVALID Janus on purpose): `x += x` has the assigned
// variable on the right-hand side, which Janus forbids because it is not
// invertible (`x -= x` zeroes x instead of halving it).  pyjanus2pisa accepts
// it ("self-referencing assignment optimization"), so the round trip fails
// on both interpreters while fwd/bwd still agree.
int x = 21
procedure main
  x += x
